        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo umweshi walenga cine lubali wafikile, ninshi abena Israeli bonse balikala mu mishi yabo, elyo bonse balongene nga bana ba ŋanda imo ku Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.27.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ukuf 27:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yeshua umwana mwaume uwakwa Yosadaki na bamunyina bashimapepo, na Serubabeli umwana mwaume wakwa Shealitieli na bamunyina, epakukuulila Lesa wa bena Israeli ubulambo bwakocelapo amalambo, ukulingana nefyo calembwa mu mafunde yakwa Mose umuntu wakwa Lesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.28.1+NUM.28.2+NUM.28.3+NUM.28.4+NUM.28.5+NUM.28.6+NUM.28.7+NUM.28.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imp 28:1-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakuula ubulambo pa mufula wa pa ncende iyakale nelyo baletiina abantu abaleikala kuli ilya incende, elyo batampa ukulatulilapo Yawe amalambo yakoca ulucelo ne cungulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.29.12+NUM.29.13+NUM.29.14+NUM.29.15+NUM.29.16+NUM.29.17+NUM.29.18+NUM.29.19+NUM.29.20+NUM.29.21+NUM.29.22+NUM.29.23+NUM.29.24+NUM.29.25+NUM.29.26+NUM.29.27+NUM.29.28+NUM.29.29+NUM.29.30+NUM.29.31+NUM.29.32+NUM.29.33+NUM.29.34+NUM.29.35+NUM.29.36+NUM.29.37+NUM.29.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imp 29:12-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balasefya ne nshikunkulu ya Nsakwe ukulingana nefyo calembwa. Cila bushiku baletuula amalambo yakoca ukukonka ne mpendwa iya fyalefwaikwa cila bushiku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Imp 28:11—29:39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili balikonkenyepo ukuleka amalambo yakoca. Balundapo na ya mweshi upya, na ya nshikunkulu shimbi ishakupepelamo Yawe elyo ne mituulo cila muntu ali nokutuula kuli Yawe kukuitemenwafye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubushiku bwakutampa umweshi uwalenga cine lubali batampile ukutuula kuli Yawe amalambo yakoca nelyo bali tabalapwa ukwimba umufula wakukuulilapo Itempele lyakwa Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo bapeela indalama ku bakasona wa mabwe na bakabasa wa mbao. Bapeela ifyakulya ne fyakunwa na mafuta ya miolifa ku bena Sidoni na bena Turi. Bacitile ifi fyonse pakuti batwale imilando ya fimuti ifyalepesha ifya keda pali bemba ukufuma ku Lebanoni ukutwala ku Yopa ukulingana ne nsambu bapeelwe kuli Sairasi imfumu ya ku Pesia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
